WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.950
Let's add a service customers can book.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.250
You check the price
before anything goes live.

3
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.888
Services and Pricing starts here.

4
00:00:08.638 --> 00:00:12.138
Selestial can draft services
from what you already told it,

5
00:00:11.888 --> 00:00:15.138
you can import a price list,
or you can create one yourself.

6
00:00:16.288 --> 00:00:17.988
Create one yourself.

7
00:00:17.738 --> 00:00:21.038
Give it the name customers will
see, and the kind of cleaning.

8
00:00:24.288 --> 00:00:25.975
You land in the editor.

9
00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:27.425
Nothing is live yet.

10
00:00:27.175 --> 00:00:31.163
When the price and scope are
right, choose Review and publish.

11
00:00:30.913 --> 00:00:33.775
Customers only see a service
after you publish it.

12
00:00:34.925 --> 00:00:37.300
Next, add the people who do the work.
